      "content": "\"let yourself break too\"... i dont know. it just feels like there isn't even anything left to break. i look at these people, and i look at my hands, and i just feel this massive, heavy nothingness. like i've spent my whole life fighting against something that was never meant to be won. it all feels so pointless.",
